{"4420440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Legacy of Sail", "steam_appid": 4420440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legacy of Sail: As a 17th Century Admiral, send your squadrons out to capture enemy towns and sink their ships. Force boarding actions to capture their prized Ships of the Line all while balancing the need for supplies, repairs and upgrading your crew in this throwback real time tactics naval combat game</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command your fleet in 16 different single player scenarios attempting to smash the enemy squadrons and capture their ports in this old-school real-time tactics naval simulation.   Complete against 7 different AI personalities on 4 different difficulty levels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Command your squadrons in real time naval combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leverage your mastery of the wind and cannon fire to send your foes to the bottom of the sea</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4420440/extras/1086e62a613705ceeff5fcbcb146a809.poster.avif?t=1786149563\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4420440/extras/1086e62a613705ceeff5fcbcb146a809.webm?t=1786149563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4420440/extras/1086e62a613705ceeff5fcbcb146a809.mp4?t=1786149563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Close and board with prize ships</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you can't do with cannons you can do hand to hand!   Board the enemy ship and take her as a prize or scuttle her and watch the enemy fleet shrink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4420440/extras/63f45d8cb83971c699f297ef590cf5a7.poster.avif?t=1786149563\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4420440/extras/63f45d8cb83971c699f297ef590cf5a7.webm?t=1786149563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4420440/extras/63f45d8cb83971c699f297ef590cf5a7.mp4?t=1786149563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Capture the enemy's ports and capital</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maneuver your squadrons to capture ports or hunt down the enemy ships on the strategic map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4420440/extras/d2331ebfc3954fd9b4c8a2b8b06ac3f9.poster.avif?t=1786149563\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4420440/extras/d2331ebfc3954fd9b4c8a2b8b06ac3f9.webm?t=1786149563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4420440/extras/d2331ebfc3954fd9b4c8a2b8b06ac3f9.mp4?t=1786149563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Maintain your ships and deny the enemy repairs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your ships in good supply and find safe ports for repairs.   Use your faster squadrons to hunt enemy supply ships and prevent them from repairing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poste